    Executive: accept hyphenated Execution-Host in eligible-work discovery
    
    Recognize Execution-Host/Execution-Target style hyphenated assignment
    forms in explicit() and Founder comment prefix checks, so standing
    Founder mandates using the hyphenated form are detected as billy-dev
    eligible work. Adds regression smoke test.
    
    Refs: H-1795476325-pnp-continuity

